choam-io/cmux

This software is a modified version of cmux, originally developed by
Manaflow, Inc. (https://github.com/manaflow-ai/cmux).

The original work is dual-licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later and a commercial
license. This fork is distributed under the same GPL-3.0-or-later terms.
See LICENSE for the full text.

Modifications by choam-io include:

  - Removal of all telemetry (PostHog, Sentry) -- replaced with no-op stubs
  - Addition of prefix key mode (tmux-style keybinding layer)
  - Addition of direct Ctrl+h/j/k/l vim-aware pane navigation
  - Addition of pi agent session restore support
  - Addition of browser tabs and configurable bookmark launcher
  - Addition of NerdFont glyph rendering in sidebar and command palette
  - Bundle-aware socket directory name derivation
  - CI/release workflow adapted for choam-io fork
  - Bundle ID changed to io.choam.cmux

The upstream repository is: https://github.com/manaflow-ai/cmux
The source for this fork is: https://github.com/choam-io/cmux
